msgctxt "124"
msgid "I come here all the time. Their food's out of this world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Ha! Imagine runnin' into you in a place like this! You got that hundred "
"grand ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Oh, uh... er..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "(What's going on?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"(I borrowed eighty thou from this loan shark when I lost money on the "
"horses the other day.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "(Can't you just make something up so he'll leave us alone? Please?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"C'mon, 100,000, including interest! Pay up now or it'll just keep growin', "
"pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "(We're in the middle of something here. Take this and leave us alone.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Let's see here... Yep, that makes 100,000 yen, all right! Thank you kindly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"What's this? Are you borrowing money? You know that'll bring you nothing "
"but trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I know, I know. Your grandson is always scolding me about it, too. Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"(We're kind of in the middle of something right now. I'll pay you, I "
"promise. Just come back later.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Sure, pal. That's what they all say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Oh, all right. I guess I'll have to pay this time. Here's your 100,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Let's see here... Yep, that makes 100,000 yen, all right! Thank you kindly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "You can pay me back through Masahiko. And stop borrowing so much, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Absolutely! The 100,000 yen set you ordered, right? I'll make sure our "
"president sends it to you right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Yeah? You're not makin' any sense, pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I'll make sure our president sends it to you right away. Please understand. "
"That's all we can do today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Well, as long as you pay the interest, too... I guess I got no complaints. "
"No slackin' off, though, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Oh, a work conversation! You must be awfully busy to be talking shop even "
"on your breaks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Loans, huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You better pay them before they get too big."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"I didn't know you were in debt, Masahiko. Didn't I tell you to watch your "
"expenses?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Er, well... it's just... I got a little carried away at the racetrack, "
"that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Oh, all right. I guess I'll have to pay this time. Here's your 100,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Let's see here... Yep, that makes 100,000 yen, all right! Thank you kindly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Now, Masahiko, I didn't give you that money, you know. You've got to pay me "
"back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Is everybody ready for some yakiniku? Eat up, Granny. It'll make you strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Pay the 100,000 Yen"
msgstr ""

